  "description": "A surreal and abstract image of a figure draped in a black fabric that obscures their identity. The fabric is smooth and tightly fitted, creating a mysterious and faceless silhouette. Overlaid on the figure's face is a vibrant, glitch-like digital pattern composed of horizontal bars in bright colors such as red, orange, yellow, blue, and white. The digital distortion effect contrasts sharply with the dark, matte texture of the fabric, creating a striking visual juxtaposition. The background is minimal and neutral, ensuring the focus remains on the figure and the digital overlay.",
